					"Type":0,
					"Lines":[
						{
							"Character":"Gena",
							"Text":"Ah, just like old times. Now this I can understand. Artillery shoots far, up to four tiles away, but it cannot move and shoot in the same turn. It is powerful against most targets that get close enough for it to shoot.",
